**Type: [`Options`](2-options.md)**

The options used to make the request.

### `stream.response`

**Type: [`IncomingMessage`](https://nodejs.org/api/http.html#http_class_http_incomingmessage)**

The underlying `IncomingMessage` instance.

### `stream.requestUrl`

